    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Potion, Uncommon</em></p><p>After drinking this potion, you can take a Bonus Action to exhale fire at a target within 30 feet of yourself. The target makes a DC 13 Dexterity saving throw, taking 4d6 Fire damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. The effect ends after you exhale the fire three times or when 1 hour has passed.</p><p>This potion’s orange liquid flickers, and smoke fills the top of the container and wafts out whenever it is opened.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-BFifEP13CxXrD0kn\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Les 3 utilisations de la potion sont ses 3 souffles : <em>Drink</em> applique l’effet (1 heure) sans rien consommer, chaque <em>Exhale Fire</em> consomme une utilisation et la potion disparaît après le troisième. Si l’heure passe avant, supprimez la potion.</p></section>",
